100000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
#201
corwell citizen~
the citizen of Corwell~
A citizen of Corwell passes on his way home.~
This person looks like an ordinary citizen of the Moonshae Islands.~
